@host = https://localhost:7162
@branchId = 1
@roomId = 1
@token = paste-a-login-token-here

### Public hotel profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/hotel

### Choose a branch
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches?Location=Warri

### Find available rooms for the stay
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/rooms?checkIn=2027-01-10&checkOut=2027-01-12&guests=2

### Room photos and specifications
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/rooms/{{roomId}}?checkIn=2027-01-10&checkOut=2027-01-12

### Twin beds: rooms 160–200 on the first floor
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/rooms?checkIn=2027-01-10&checkOut=2027-01-12&isTwinRoom=true&guests=2

### Honeymoon suites: VVIP third floor and Platinum highest floor
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/rooms?checkIn=2027-01-10&checkOut=2027-01-12&isHoneymoonSuite=true&guests=2

### Platinum honeymoon suites at their advertised room price
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/rooms?checkIn=2027-01-10&checkOut=2027-01-12&isHoneymoonSuite=true&category=Platinum&guests=2

### Kitchen menu
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/offerings?kind=Meal

### Pool and outdoor options: use Pool, OutdoorActivity, Bar or Lounge
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/offerings?kind=Pool

### Book a selected room after login (replace the sample dates/IDs)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": {{branchId}},
  "checkIn": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-01-12",
  "guests": 2,
  "rooms": 1,
  "roomIds": [{{roomId}}]
}

### Branch administrator inventory
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}/admin/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
